General_SiSo_Auto_NR_DL_Test_Model_Activation_With_VSWR_Readout
    [Documentation]
    ...  Starts NR Downlink Test Model via selenium with VSWR readout. Then checks if VSWR readouts appear and have
    ...  correct count and values. Test case requires to use "Enter Test Dedicated State" KW in test setup.
    ...  :param str test_model: (Mandatory) :
    ...         One of following NR DL test models supported for cell configuration:
    ...             "TM1.1", "TM1.2",
    ...             "TM2", "TM2A",
    ...             "TM3.1", "TM3.1A", "TM3.2", "TM3.3", "TM3.3N",
    ...             "TM1.1_ETSI".
    ...  :param int cell_id: (Mandatory) :
    ...         Global cell id of tested NR cell, e.g.: 1.
    ...  :param int test_model_duration: (Optional) :
    ...         Duration (in seconds) of downlink test model.
    ...         Default value: 60
    ...  :param str polarization: (Optional) :
    ...         One of following: "P_plus45_or_0", "P_minus45_or_90", "P_both", default "P_both".
    ...         Default value: P_both
    ...  :param int beam_id: (Optional) :
    ...         beamPatternId parameter, range <0 to 1200> default 1.
    ...         Default value: 1
    ...  :param float/None pmax: (Optional) :
    ...         pmax parameter, range <0 to 60 step=0.1>,
    ...         if None, pmax will be read from current SCF configuration on BTS.
    ...         Default value: None
    ...  :param int power_backoff: (Optional) :
    ...         powerBackoff parameter, range <0 to 490>, default None means default WebEM value will not be changed.
    ...         Default value: None
    ...  :param str type_of_load: (Optional) :
    ...         loadType parameter, one of following: "flatLoad", "burstLoad", default None means default WebEM value
    ...         will not be changed.
    ...         Default value: None
    ...  :param str level_of_load_flat: (Optional) :
    ...         loadLevelFlat parameter, one of following: "low", "medium", "busy", "full", default None means default
    ...         WebEM value will not be changed.
    ...         Default value: None
    ...  :param str level_of_load_burst: (Optional) :
    ...         loadLevelBurst parameter, one of following: burst_13_5", "burst_19_2", "burst_32_7", "burst_46_2",
    ...         "burst_59_6", "burst_73_1", "burst_86_5", "burst_100", default None means default WebEM value will
    ...         not be changed.
    ...         Default value: None
    ...  :param str spec_ssb_beam_pattern: (Optional) :
    ...         numOfSsbBeamPatternId parameter, one of following: "ssb_4", "ssb_8", "ssb_32", default None means
    ...         default WebEM value will not be changed.
    ...         Default value: None
    ...  :param str text_for_test: (Optional) :
    ...         Some message used in test result data,
    ...         Default value: "lorem ipsum".
    ...  :param int timeout: (Optional) :
    ...         Timeout (in seconds) for test model startup and termination.
    ...         Default value: 60

    [Arguments]                                         ${test_model}
    ...                                                 ${cell_id}
    ...                                                 ${test_model_duration}=60
    ...                                                 ${polarization}=P_both
    ...                                                 ${beam_id}=1
    ...                                                 ${pmax}=${None}
    ...                                                 ${power_backoff}=${None}
    ...                                                 ${type_of_load}=${None}
    ...                                                 ${level_of_load_flat}=${None}
    ...                                                 ${level_of_load_burst}=${None}
    ...                                                 ${spec_ssb_beam_pattern}=${None}
    ...                                                 ${text_for_test}=lorem ipsum
    ...                                                 ${timeout}=60
    [Timeout]                                           24 hours

    ${bts_type}=                                        hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                                      connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${webui_obj}=                                       Create Selenium Session
    ...                                                 admin_connection=${connection}
    ...                                                 download_dir=${logs_path}

    ${cells_params}=                                    tm_setup_adm.get_cell_parameters_required_to_setup_test_model
    ...                                                 cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    ${local_cell}=                                      scf.get_correct_local_cell_name
    ...                                                 cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    ${test_pmax}=                                       Get Pmax For Test Module Activation
    ...                                                 cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                 pmax=${pmax}
    ...                                                 download_dir=/tmp
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    &{nrarfcn}=                                         tm_setup_adm.get_nrafcn_variables_for_nr_cell_id
    ...                                                 cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}

    Remove All Test Modules Result Files                download_dir=${logs_path}
    Start Downlink Test                                 test_model=${test_model}
    ...                                                 local_cell=${local_cell}
    ...                                                 physical_cell_id=${cells_params["phy_cellid"]}
    ...                                                 polarization=${polarization}
    ...                                                 beam_id=${beam_id}
    ...                                                 p_max=${test_pmax}
    ...                                                 power_backoff=${power_backoff}
    ...                                                 type_of_load=${type_of_load}
    ...                                                 level_of_load_flat=${level_of_load_flat}
    ...                                                 level_of_load_burst=${level_of_load_burst}
    ...                                                 spec_ssb_beam_pattern=${spec_ssb_beam_pattern}
    ...                                                 timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                 enable_vswr=${True}
    ...                                                 &{nrarfcn}

    Robot Log Operation                                 Test model ${test_model} has started successfully
    sleep                                               ${test_model_duration}
    ...                                                 reason=Waiting 60s for test model performing...

    ${vswr_results}=                                    Get Vswr Monitored Value
    Robot Log Operation                                 ${vswr_results}

    Robot Log Operation                                 Verifying values for VSWR measurement...
    Verify Content Of Vswr Results                      vswr_results=${vswr_results}
    ...                                                 test_model_duration=${test_model_duration}

    Robot Log Operation                                 Verifying timestamps for VSWR measurement...
    Verify Timestamps In Vswr Monitored Values          vswr_results=${vswr_results}

    ${result_file_path}                                 Stop Downlink Test Module And Save Results
    ...                                                 text_for_test=${text_for_test}
    ...                                                 download_dir=${logs_path}
    ...                                                 nr_cell=${cell_id}
    ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    ...                                                 timeout=${timeout}

    Check Content Of Test Results And Refresh Page      text_for_test=${text_for_test}
    ...                                                 result_file_path=${result_file_path}
    Check Unavailability Of Downlink Test Module        nr_cell=${cell_id}
    ...                                                 test_model=${test_model}

    [Teardown]                                          Downlink Test Activation Teardown
